# Gate Colossus: "Whenever a Gate you control enters, you may put this card from your graveyard on top of your library."
# Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (Black Lotus and five Moxen); Bot2 destroys it with Wrath of God on turn 2 (Black Lotus
# and Mox Pearl: {2}{W}{W}). Bot1 draws Talon Gates of Madara on turn 3 and plays it: the Colossus's graveyard trigger
# asks, Bot1 accepts, and it goes on top of the library (21 cards: the 28-card deck less the opening seven and the
# turn-3 draw, plus the Colossus), leaving only the spent Black Lotus in the graveyard.

